  "description": "Build model selectors, readiness checks and operations dashboards for Ollama, llama.cpp and vLLM through runtime-neutral contracts. What's New in v1.0.0: server information, health, model inventory and capabilities, plus optional lifecycle, download-progress and metrics interfaces. Immutable observations distinguish installation from loading and preserve unknown states. Targets .NET Standard 2.1 with no package dependencies; concrete HTTP clients live in separate Serving packages. No server hosting or inference API.",
